== Tips ==
*Despite being the best pet for {{Stat|Ferocity}}, this pet has incredibly limited usage. {{Stat|Ferocity}} doesn't properly work with bows, because the extra hit counts as a melee hit, and as such isn't booster by {{ench|Power}} and other effects for bows, and is heavily nerfed using it with melee weapons as [[Berserk]] in [[Dungeons]]. Players should use a {{Item|Lion Pet|rarity=leg}} for melee or a {{Item|Skeleton Pet|rarity=leg}} for Archer.

== Trivia ==
* The '''Tiger Pet'''{{'}}s {{AN|Merciless Swipe}} ability does not increase {{Stat|fero}} by a set number; instead, it multiplies the player's {{Stat|Ferocity}}. For example, a Level {{Green|100}} '''Tiger Pet''' will grant {{Stat|ferocity|32.5}}, not {{Green|55}}.
* The '''Tiger Pet'''{{'}}s {{AN|Apex Predator}} plays a sound effect when hitting isolated mobs.
* The '''Tiger Pet''' used to be used in [[Floor IV]], as a bug caused {{Stat|Ferocity}} granted by the '''Tiger Pet''' to hit {{MobSprite|Thorn}} twice.

